    "created_at": "2016-04-05T13:17:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-05T13:19:12Z",
    "body": "So interestingly, `document.origin` is only implemented in Blink, and sort of in WebKit. In Safari on my iPad http://jsbin.com/velohejexi/edit?html,console returns `\"http_null.jsbin.com_0\"`. (In Chrome it returns `\"http://null.jsbin.com\"`.)\n\nSo maybe we should remove `document.origin`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
