    "body": "Yeah, I would be okay with removing `document.origin` if @bzbarsky, @jeisinger, et al, are on board with that. That's a simple change to the DOM Standard.\n\nI will add an example contrasting `self.origin` and `location.origin` later and ping this thread.\n",
